      "record_sha256": "d2b85c5589ec452bd7891a6fa2114a84020d346ef84785f6750f755f6f240624",
      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "Could Rohin\u2019s report of the raw child\u2019s Next-Steps handshake\u2014carrying unfinished work forward and checking what happened before reporting progress\u2014guide this revision? With \u201ccolored sound\u201d removed, what does the feather-touch moment reveal about Whisker beyond \u201cafraid and excited\u201d? Would closer thought settle what her response should express, or would a few new lines provide better evidence? Where will you focus attention, and what thinking or writing step do you choose to complete now? What observation in the passage would change your choice? What finding from the draft, uncertainty, and unfinished next step will you carry forward?"
